# Signing key material. Release builds read the keystore from $STORE_FILE, which CI decodes from a
# secret, so one should never be committed -- and the release setup generates a keystore in the
# working tree, leaving it a single `git add .` away from being published irrecoverably.
*.jks
*.p12
*.keystore
